IRM2 / PragmaBot on Franka FR3
==============================

This repository reproduces and extends PragmaBot (Qu et al., IEEE RAL 2026)
on a Franka FR3. It vendors several third-party projects, each of which keeps
its own LICENSE file in its own directory.

